MOS Storage Specification v0.1.0
Part VI — Canonical Relational Schema

Status: Draft for freeze
Authority: MOS Storage Specification
Database: PostgreSQL
Primary identifier: UUID
Primary time model: UTC
Primary source of truth: Authoritative relational state + immutable event/provenance history

1. Storage Architecture

MOS divides storage into six classes:

┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                 MOS STORAGE                  │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                              │
│  AUTHORITATIVE                               │
│  ├── identity                                │
│  ├── event                                   │
│  ├── memory                                  │
│  ├── provenance                              │
│  ├── knowledge                               │
│  ├── cognition                               │
│  ├── planning                                │
│  └── execution                               │
│                                              │
│  DERIVED                                     │
│  ├── graph                                   │
│  ├── embedding                               │
│  └── retrieval                               │
│                                              │
│  EPHEMERAL                                   │
│  └── cache                                   │
│                                              │
│  DISTRIBUTED                                 │
│  └── network                                 │
│                                              │
│  OPERATIONAL                                 │
│  ├── telemetry                               │
│  └── system                                  │
│                                              │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘

The distinction is fundamental.
